.IX Title "PMDASNMP 1"
.TH PMDASNMP 1 "Performance Co-Pilot" 7.2.0 "Performance Co-Pilot"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pmdasnmp \- Gateway from SNMP to PCP (PMDA)
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBpmdasnmp\fR is a Performance Metrics Domain Agent (PMDA) which
provides a generic gateway from PCP queries from a PCP client to SNMP queries
to one or more SNMP agents.
.SH INSTALLATION
.IX Header "INSTALLATION"
If you want access to the SNMP gateway performance
metrics, do the following as root:
.PP
.Vb 2
\&        # cd $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/snmp
\&        # ./Install
.Ve
.PP
If you want to undo the installation, do the following as root:
.PP
.Vb 2
\&        # cd $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/snmp
\&        # ./Remove
.Ve
.PP
\&\fBpmdasnmp\fR is launched by \fBpmcd\fR\|(1) and should never be executed
directly.  The Install and Remove scripts notify \fBpmcd\fR\|(1) when
the agent is installed or removed.
.SH "پیکربندی (CONFIGURATION)"
.IX Header "CONFIGURATION"
